B.a7q=new A.c6(B.lP,["future-urban-mobility","The Future of Urban Mobility in Kenya","Technology","5 min read","assets/images/future-urban-mobility.jpg","How Cabi is transforming the way Nairobi moves with decentralized ride-hailing, electric bodas, and fair driver revenue sharing.","Fees charged are not for corporate enrichment, but are actively recycled into driver wealth creation and vehicle asset equity.","Cabi Operations Team"],t.li)
